/></svg><b>Big Comfy Hood</b><p>An oversized hood that actually stays up, made for movie nights and cold mornings.</p></div><div class=\"it\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 10h10v5a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H10a4 4 0 0 1-4-4z\"/><path d=\"M16 11h1.6a2.2 2.2 0 0 1 0 4.4H16\"/><path d=\"M9 4c1 1-1 2 0 3\"/><path d=\"M12.5 4c1 1-1 2 0 3\"/></svg><b>Cozy in Seconds</b><p>Slip it on, tie the belt, done. No fuss, just warm.</p></div><div class=\"it\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v20\"/><path d=\"M3.3 7 20.7 17\"/><path d=\"M20.7 7 3.3 17\"/><path d=\"M12 8l2-1.2M12 8 10 6.8\"/><path d=\"M12 16l2 1.2M12 16l-2 1.2\"/><path d=\"M7 9.5 5 9M7 9.5 6.5 11.5\"/><path d=\"M17 14.5 19 15M17 14.5 16.5 12.5\"/><path d=\"M17 9.5 19 9M17 9.5 16.5 11.5\"/><path d=\"M7 14.5 5 15M7 14.5 7.5 12.5\"/></svg><b>No Scratchy Feel</b><p>No scratchy seams, just soft brushed fleece from the hood down.</p></div></div><script>(function(){var el=document.getElementById('hwIr');if(!el)return;if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)){el.classList.add('in');return;}var o=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){el.classList.add('in');o.disconnect();}});},{threshold:.35});o.observe(el);})();</script>",
